<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 125,000 tonnes soft wheat.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 125,000 tonnes soft wheat.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Wednesday launched a tender for the purchase of five lots of soft wheat of 25,000 tonnes each or more, traders said.</p>
<p>Last deadline for submitting offers was set for Friday March 14 at 0930 GMT.  </p>
<p>Shipment dates for the five lots of wheat are - April 20-30, May 1-10, May 10-20, May 20-30 and June 1-10. --Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
